      "content": "rebuilding sounds like a joke. you talk about it like there's still something to build on, but the foundation is just gone. it's not just about the money or the assets, it's like... the person i was for those 20 years doesn't even exist anymore. i'm just a shell. i look at the clock and realize i've spent my most valuable years on a zero sum game. how am i supposed to care about \"steps\" when the whole game is rigged and i've already lost everything?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
